"ais://$BUCKET_1" created
"ais://$BUCKET_2" created
^PUT.*=> ais://$BUCKET_1/obj_1.txt$

^PUT.*=> ais://$BUCKET_1/obj_2.txt$

^PUT.*=> ais://$BUCKET_1/obj_3.txt$

Archived ais://$BUCKET_1/obj_{1..3}.txt => ais://$BUCKET_2/tmpl.tar
Archived ais://$BUCKET_1/obj_1.txt, obj_2.txt, obj_3.txt => ais://$BUCKET_2/list.tar
Archived ais://$BUCKET_1/obj_1.txt => ais://$BUCKET_2/timeout.tar
^Archiving ais://$BUCKET_1/obj_1.txt, obj_2.txt => ais://$BUCKET_2/nowait.tar. To monitor the progress, run 'ais show job .*'$
^APPEND.*ais://$BUCKET_2/tmpl.tar as "fourth.txt"$

